ll,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"Como mencionei, n\u00e3o sou especialista em receitas culin\u00e1rias. Minha expertise est\u00e1 focada em fornecer conselhos sobre programas de milhas a\u00e9reas e c\u00e1lculos relacionados.\\n\\nSe voc\u00ea tiver alguma d\u00favida sobre como maximizar o uso de suas milhas para viajar pagando menos, como analisar se determinada passagem vale mais a pena com milhas ou dinheiro, posso ajudar com essas an\u00e1lises. Caso contr\u00e1rio, recomendo consultar um site ou livro de receitas culin\u00e1rias para obter instru\u00e7\u00f5es sobre como fazer bolos.\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"grounding_metadata\":null,\"partial\":false,\"turn_complete\":null,\"finish_reason\":\"STOP\",\"error_code\":null,\"error_message\":null,\"interrupted\":null,\"custom_metadata\":{\"__llm_request_key__\":\"fb9a1471-7638-429c-a8f3-1d160ce389bd\"},\"usage_metadata\":{\"cache_tokens_details\":null,\"cached_content_token_count\":0,\"candidates_token_count\":145,\"candidates_tokens_details\":null,\"prompt_token_count\":857,\"prompt_tokens_details\":null,\"thoughts_token_count\":null,\"tool_use_prompt_token_count\":null,\"tool_use_prompt_tokens_details\":null,\"total_token_count\":1002,\"traffic_type\":null},\"live_session_resumption_update\":null,\"input_transcription\":null,\"output_transcription\":null,\"avg_logprobs\":null,\"logprobs_result\":null,\"cache_metadata\":null,\"citation_metadata\":null,\"interaction_id\":null,\"invocation_id\":\"e-6dcff1ac-1e2a-44a6-afc3-1e4b37fe1563\",\"author\":\"root_agent\",\"actions\":{\"skip_summarization\":null,\"state_delta\":{\"__llm_request_key__\":\"fb9a1471-7638-429c-a8f3-1d160ce389bd\"},\"artifact_delta\":{},\"transfer_to_agent\":null,\"escalate\":null,\"requested_auth_configs\":{},\"requested_tool_confirmations\":{},\"compaction\":null,\"end_of_agent\":null,\"agent_state\":null,\"rewind_before_invocation_id\":null},\"long_running_tool_ids\":null,\"branch\":null,\"id\":\"562d39cc-1628-4205-8119-50f21f141a6e\",\"timestamp\":1766077248.100479},{\"model_version\":null,\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"qual a diferen\u00e7a de pontos e milhas?\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"user\"},\"grounding_metadata\":null,\"partial\":null,\"turn_complete\":null,\"finish_reason\":null,\"error_code\":null,\"error_message\":null,\"interrupted\":null,\"custom_metadata\":null,\"usage_metadata\":null,\"live_session_resumption_update\":null,\"input_transcription\":null,\"output_transcription\":null,\"avg_logprobs\":null,\"logprobs_result\":null,\"cache_metadata\":null,\"citation_metadata\":null,\"interaction_id\":null,\"invocation_id\":\"e-6a73d29a-524e-494c-8fcf-4c5266aa949e\",\"author\":\"user\",\"actions\":{\"skip_summarization\":null,\"state_delta\":{},\"artifact_delta\":{},\"transfer_to_agent\":null,\"escalate\":null,\"requested_auth_configs\":{},\"requested_tool_confirmations\":{},\"compaction\":null,\"end_of_agent\":null,\"agent_state\":null,\"rewind_before_invocation_id\":null},\"long_running_tool_ids\":null,\"branch\":null,\"id\":\"02d2738e-eeaf-4fb8-955c-f55ce6b1ba37\",\"timestamp\":1766077251.019425},{\"model_version\":\"anthropic.claude-3-sonnet-20240229-v1:0\",\"content\":{\"parts\":[{\"media_resolution\":null,\"code_execution_result\":null,\"executable_code\":null,\"file_data\":null,\"function_call\":null,\"function_response\":null,\"inline_data\":null,\"text\":\"Pontos e milhas s\u00e3o diferentes tipos de programas de fidelidade, mas ambos funcionam de forma semelhante, permitindo que voc\u00ea acumule e resgate recompensas.\\n\\nMilhas:\\n- Geralmente s\u00e3o oferecidas por companhias a\u00e9reas como recompensa por voos realizados.\\n- Podem ser resgatadas principalmente por passagens a\u00e9reas gr\u00e1tis ou upgrades.\\n- Algumas milhas tamb\u00e9m permitem resgates em hot\u00e9is, alugu\u00e9is de carros, etc.\\n\\nPontos:\\n- S\u00e3o comumente oferecidos por programas de cart\u00f5es de cr\u00e9dito, redes de hot\u00e9is, locadoras de carros ao fazer compras/reservas.\\n- Podem ser resgatados por uma gama mais ampla de produtos e servi\u00e7os al\u00e9m de viagens, como eletr\u00f4nicos, vale-presente, etc.\\n- Existem programas de pontos espec\u00edficos para marcas, varejistas ou bancos.\\n\\nA principal diferen\u00e7a \u00e9 que as milhas est\u00e3o vinculadas diretamente \u00e0s viagens de avi\u00e3o, enquanto os pontos t\u00eam um escopo de resgate mais amplo, n\u00e3o se limitando apenas a passagens a\u00e9reas. Mas ambos concedem recompensas com base em sua atividade de consumo ou viagem.\",\"thought\":null,\"thought_signature\":null,\"video_metadata\":null}],\"role\":\"model\"},\"grounding_metadata\":null,\"partial\":false,\"turn_complete\":null,\"finish_reason\":\"STOP\",\"error_code\":null,\"error_message\":null,\"interrupted\":null,\"custom_metadata\":{\"__llm_request_key__\":\"6210a85f-2fa6-4c6a-ad09-4c0ace25c3c4\"},\"usage_metadata\":{\"cache_tokens_details\":null,\"cached_content_token_count\":0,\"candidates_token_count\":311,\"candidates_tokens_details\":null,\"prompt_token_count\":1016,\"prompt_tokens_details\":null,\"thoughts_token_count\":null,\"tool_use_prompt_token_count\":null,\"tool_use_prompt_tokens_details\":null,\"total_token_count\":1327,\"traffic_type\":null},\"live_session_resumption_update\":null,\"input_transcription\":null,\"output_transcription\":null,\"avg_logprobs\":null,\"logprobs_result\":null,\"cache_metadata\":null,\"citation_metadata\":null,\"interaction_id\":null,\"invocation_id\":\"e-6a73d29a-524e-494c-8fcf-4c5266aa949e\",\"author\":\"root_agent\",\"actions\":{\"skip_summarization\":